<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Assistant Maths — v1.0</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/retro.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/chat.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="window" id="chat-window">
        <div class="title-bar">
            <div class="title-bar-controls">
                <button aria-label="Minimize"></button>
                <button aria-label="Maximize"></button>
                <button aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <h1 class="title-bar-text">💬 Assistant Maths — Session de chat</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="window-body">
            <div class="chat-messages" id="chat-messages">
                <div class="message bot">
                    <div class="avatar">🤖</div>
                    <div class="bubble">
                        <div class="msg-header">Assistant · <span class="msg-time">14:02</span></div>
                        <p>Bonjour 👋 Je suis votre assistant de mathématiques. Posez-moi vos questions&nbsp;!</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="message user">
                    <div class="avatar">🧑‍🎓</div>
                    <div class="bubble">
                        <div class="msg-header">Moi · <span class="msg-time">14:03</span></div>
                        <p>Bonjour, comment résoudre x + 3 = 7 ?</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="message bot">
                    <div class="avatar">🤖</div>
                    <div class="bubble">
                        <div class="msg-header">Assistant · <span class="msg-time">14:03</span></div>
                        <p>Pour résoudre x + 3 = 7, on isole x en soustrayant 3 aux deux membres&nbsp;: x = 7 − 3, donc <strong>x = 4</strong>.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <form class="chat-input" id="chat-form" autocomplete="off">
                <input type="text" id="chat-input" placeholder="Tapez votre message ici..." aria-label="Message">
                <button type="submit" class="send-btn">Envoyer ➤</button>
            </form>
        </div>

        <div class="status-bar">
            <span class="status-field">Prêt</span>
            <span class="status-field">2 messages</span>
            <span class="status-field">CSS rétro v1.0</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="/static/js/chat.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
